<topic id="custom-option-batchmatches">
  <title>Print a greeting with Node.js</title>
  <body>
    <p>Define the name to greet:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-javascript">const name = "Doc Detective";</codeblock>
    <p>Print the greeting:</p>
    <codeblock outputclass="language-javascript">console.log(`Hello, ${name}!`);</codeblock>
  </body>
